      "title": "Extract and type the secretariat card state",
      "body": "The new card combines two server-action result shapes as inline state types, casts both results back to those types, and renders the complete details panel in one JSX expression. Give observations and issued documents named shared view-model types, then extract the document and observation sections into small components. This removes unchecked assertions and makes the role-limited interface practical to evolve or test independently.",
      "rule_ids": [],
      "guideline": null,
      "suggestion": null,
      "evidence": [
        "Premise: app/admin/solicitacoes/client.tsx:103-136 stores inline duplicated result shapes and uses `as typeof notes` / `as typeof documents` before a single-line details tree → Improvement: named contracts and smaller render units make changes to action payloads compiler-visible and localize future UI work → Fix: define exported observation/document view-model types and extract the two details sections.",
        "app/admin/solicitacoes/client.tsx:107-109 → action results are asserted rather than assigned through a typed contract.",
        "app/admin/solicitacoes/client.tsx:136 → the full documents and observations UI is compressed into one JSX expression."
      ]
    },
